			<p>“Tenacious, diligent, incredibly smart and deeply, frustratingly sensible. If he called me out on something, he was right almost every time. Thanks to him our quality was high, we shipped loads less bugs and still managed to ship at an incredible rate.”</p>
			<cite>Christopher Bull, CTO and founder, Ember</cite>
		</blockquote>
		<blockquote>
			<p>“A talented, thoughtful, pragmatic, and resilient engineer who not only takes ownership of tasks and brings them to completion but also works exceptionally well with others.”</p>
			<cite>Andrew Revak, lead server engineer, Laguna Games</cite>
		</blockquote>
		<blockquote>
			<p>“Knowledgeable on a variety of aspects and direct on feedback, expert at cutting to the chase.”</p>
			<cite>Bruno Antunes, V7</cite>
		</blockquote>
		<p><small>More on <a href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>.</small></p>
	</section>

	<section id="rate">
		<h2>Rate</h2>
		<p>€1,050 per day, billed in whole days. Terms for longer engagements are available on request.</p>
	</section>

	<section id="contact">
		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>To discuss a project, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. A short description of the problem is enough to start.</p>
